ctok-java

Java port of ctok by Sander Land:
https://github.com/sanderland/ctok

Upstream version: 1.3.0
Upstream commit: ad78ea15a1febf983b379475b20f5a2b0d2ebe76
Copyright (c) 2026 Sander Land
Java port copyright (c) 2026 Clemens Runge

The tokenizer implementation, vocabulary, byte fallback, witness records,
and regression examples are derived from the upstream project under the
MIT License. The complete license and both copyright notices are in LICENSE.

Source mapping:
- Ctok.java: ctok/main.py and ctok/engine.py
- TextNormalizer.java: ctok/normalize.py and ctok/constants.py
- Notation.java: ctok/notation.py and ctok/constants.py
- v3.bin: ctok/data/pieces_v3.json
- v4_7.bin: ctok/data/pieces_v4_7.json
- unicode.bin: upstream classification/case rules evaluated with the
  reference Python unicodedata and regex Unicode tables
- generate_parity.py: upstream API regression rows, corpus texts, and
  vocabulary witness probes executed through the Python reference API

PROVENANCE.json records upstream vocabulary hashes, model metadata, and the
reference Python/Unicode/regex versions. This port is an independent project;
it is not an official Anthropic tokenizer.
